LAME 3.100 (https://lame.sourceforge.io/), libmp3lame only, unmodified, from lame-3.100.tar.gz.
License: GNU LGPL 2.1 (see COPYING). ZedokMusic links it dynamically as a separate shared library (libmp3lame.so)
so that it can be replaced by a modified build. The decoder (mpglib) and the x86 assembly are not included.
